      "key": "073fe02",
      "nodeTitle": "item_flag_belgium",
      "sourceText": "Megtaláltad a belga zászlót! Menj vissza Belgiumba!",
      "sourceEnText": "You found the Belgian flag! Go back to Belgium.",
      "audioFile": "fr_00_073fe02.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "shelley",
      "actorId": "NARRATOR",
      "durationMs": 3135,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T01:20:44Z",
      "textHash": "aadc4014bb2bf06395f5c34de3f351cf7d6455f801cd91d7b214311b71179e14"
    },
    {
      "key": "0768ab7",
      "nodeTitle": "item_flag_switzerland",
      "sourceText": "Svájc zászlaja.",
      "sourceEnText": "Flag of Switzerland.",
      "audioFile": "fr_00_0768ab7.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "shelley",
      "actorId": "NARRATOR",
      "durationMs": 1228,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T01:19:10Z",
      "textHash": "0617b5a2d98f9712a46e6942ef3c5a6e9cb37de44bbb3eec7cec615a742006fb"
    },
    {
      "key": "079096a",
      "nodeTitle": "belgium_npc",
      "sourceText": "Köszönöm! Visszajött a zászlóm!",
      "sourceEnText": "Thank you! My flag is back!",
      "audioFile": "fr_00_079096a.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "shelley",
      "actorId": "SENIOR_F",
      "durationMs": 1881,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T01:20:03Z",
      "textHash": "c91ba564978e63305b515f648b81e6b05b88bbfbaf7c9c168083b2e02595c2a3"
    },
    {
      "key": "079ecca",
      "nodeTitle": "task_belgium",
      "sourceText": "Fekete, sárga és piros, függőleges csíkokkal.",
      "sourceEnText": "It's black, yellow, and red with vertical stripes.",
      "audioFile": "fr_00_079ecca.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "shelley",
      "actorId": "SENIOR_F",
      "durationMs": 2795,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T01:20:10Z",
      "textHash": "9751afc99dc5ab9da4c1531c77a3bf45e173573433cc928cad200c9d57f58a4d"
    },
    {
      "key": "07cc57e",
      "nodeTitle": "task_swiss",
      "sourceText": "Piros, nagy fehér kereszttel, mint egy elsősegélynyújtó készlet.",
      "sourceEnText": "It is red with a big white cross like a first aid kit.",
      "audioFile": "fr_00_07cc57e.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "shelley",
      "actorId": "SENIOR_F",
      "durationMs": 4284,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T01:18:57Z",
      "textHash": "6e3cd3b8658689c6ada4b545bb7e979fa922d04a4b291f04f5a5d2fa8a0c412c"
    },
    {
      "key": "081ac66",
      "nodeTitle": "italy_npc",
      "sourceText": "Grazie! Ez az én zászlóm!",
      "sourceEnText": "Grazie! That's my flag!",
      "audioFile": "fr_00_081ac66.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "shelley",
      "actorId": "KID_M",
      "durationMs": 1646,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T01:19:52Z",
      "textHash": "a03ced6b50772be9a42c642b3d61637af0da94b4ed32ff0477301fe9069cc7be"
    },
    {
      "key": "0868737",
      "nodeTitle": "task_france",
      "sourceText": "A zászlóm kék, fehér és piros.",
      "sourceEnText": "It's blue, white, and red.",
      "audioFile": "fr_00_0868737.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "shelley",
      "actorId": "KID_F",
      "durationMs": 2116,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T01:19:19Z",
      "textHash": "234161417d2d28c8f5b0a9653625292d53ff3f76cf5f32da238d62594900c156"
    },
    {
      "key": "08a09de",
      "nodeTitle": "quest_start",
      "sourceText": "Találkozzunk a környező országokból származó barátokkal.",
      "sourceEnText": "Let’s meet friends from nearby countries.",
      "audioFile": "fr_00_08a09de.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "shelley",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 3370,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T01:20:28Z",
      "textHash": "9f9b9b6b8c069d44a8274c2977aaf5668f1c5b73be6de67bf8ae17d618ad2c42"
    },
    {
      "key": "08a8ce8",
      "nodeTitle": "quest_start",
      "sourceText": "Európában vagyunk.",
      "sourceEnText": "We are in Europe.",
      "audioFile": "fr_00_08a8ce8.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "shelley",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1515,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T01:20:27Z",
      "textHash": "d6f5285cf2644f2e36abfe7dd47be58885818a0df5fdf8b552d173557db30ec5"
    },
    {
      "key": "091cc7c",
      "nodeTitle": "task_spain",
      "sourceText": "Keresse meg a spanyol zászlót.",
      "sourceEnText": "Find the Spanish flag.",
      "audioFile": "fr_00_091cc7c.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "shelley",
      "actorId": "ADULT_F",
      "durationMs": 1881,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T01:19:47Z",
      "textHash": "121c133af12f605040f6c664e0118b47290a4dd70dcb4070d1e62084c09b0906"
    },
    {
      "key": "0930602",
      "nodeTitle": "spain_npc",
      "sourceText": "Köszönöm. Odaadnád a luxemburgi barátomnak a zászlójukat?",
      "sourceEnText": "Thank you. Can you give my Luxembourg friend their flag?",
      "audioFile": "fr_00_0930602.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "shelley",
      "actorId": "NARRATOR",
      "durationMs": 3500,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T01:19:41Z",
      "textHash": "87020c9c69d2950565d72d0f14a5ff9f48bf392fe1d266a736bd0d89d238ad75"
    },
    {
      "key": "09635b4",
      "nodeTitle": "task_spain",
      "sourceText": "Vörös és sárga, mint a nap.",
      "sourceEnText": "It is red and yellow like the sun.",
      "audioFile": "fr_00_09635b4.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "shelley",
      "actorId": "ADULT_F",
      "durationMs": 1724,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T01:19:49Z",
      "textHash": "6550056515b6c83d8b56f3365765e6cd88eb44cda115187ba9d5f5e25fcddeb1"
    },
    {
      "key": "09cf6c9",
      "nodeTitle": "spain_npc",
      "sourceText": "Madrid Spanyolország fővárosa.",
      "sourceEnText": "Madrid is the capital of Spain.",
      "audioFile": "fr_00_09cf6c9.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "shelley",
      "actorId": "NARRATOR",
      "durationMs": 2116,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T01:19:38Z",
      "textHash": "ab61a38872172d4791b837db7d743807b9f7bbf2844b913284106c06e2b5ff54"
    },
    {
      "key": "09fe8fc",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_swiss",
      "sourceText": "Helló! Svájcból származom!",
      "sourceEnText": "Hello! I’m from Switzerland!",
      "audioFile": "fr_00_09fe8fc.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "shelley",
      "actorId": "ADULT_F",
      "durationMs": 1646,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T01:18:52Z",
      "textHash": "4422541c204a1c9a91607ab06e8908a50f0a9d91ff10ff339492bf9301c53e0e"
    },
    {
      "key": "0a20eed",
      "nodeTitle": "france_npc",
      "sourceText": "Antura összekeverte az összes zászlót!",
      "sourceEnText": "We have a problem. Antura mixed up all the flags!",
      "audioFile": "fr_00_0a20eed.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "shelley",
      "actorId": "KID_F",
      "durationMs": 2534,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T01:19:18Z",
      "textHash": "5afabb2b194a316043fbed0117aa7c432fe3648b407a5cb51243bbaa10a7071c"
    },
    {
      "key": "0a23cce",
      "nodeTitle": "spawned_italy",
      "sourceText": "Olaszország úgy néz ki a térképen, mint egy bakancs!",
      "sourceEnText": "Italy looks like a boot on the map!",
      "audioFile": "fr_00_0a23cce.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "shelley",
      "actorId": "KID_M",
      "durationMs": 2795,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T01:20:55Z",
      "textHash": "3e201c36ebfc2903bfd1bb9dfed48820cfe1571b3253818bddf4848feee1c09e"
    },
    {
      "key": "0a3d0e3",
      "nodeTitle": "luxembourg_npc",
      "sourceText": "Kis ország vagyunk, és három nyelvet beszélünk!",
      "sourceEnText": "We are a small country and speak three languages!",
      "audioFile": "fr_00_0a3d0e3.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "shelley",
      "actorId": "SENIOR_M",
      "durationMs": 2612,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T01:18:41Z",
      "textHash": "c427e67d3dec64b53d54ff17dade8fc76b728f788b95ad1c72270c28b3aefb8e"
    },
    {
      "key": "0a3f8f6",
      "nodeTitle": "monaco",
      "sourceText": "Bonjour! Monacói vagyok!",
      "sourceEnText": "Bonjour! I’m from Monaco!",
      "audioFile": "fr_00_0a3f8f6.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "shelley",
      "actorId": "ADULT_M",
      "durationMs": 1881,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T01:18:58Z",
      "textHash": "424694c9aa9aa4004468e15040d311c930393afe780a041b3977ce7920ce0c34"
    },
    {
      "key": "0a61b67",
      "nodeTitle": "belgium_npc",
      "sourceText": "Bonjour! Belgiumból származom!",
      "sourceEnText": "Bonjour! I'm from Belgium!",
      "audioFile": "fr_00_0a61b67.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "shelley",
      "actorId": "SENIOR_F",
      "durationMs": 1829,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T01:20:06Z",
      "textHash": "adfb435415bfdb2ab11b724df7df498b5bf45b480d5719d73de925335b0b1e38"
    },
    {
      "key": "0a9b166",
      "nodeTitle": "item_flag_france",
      "sourceText": "Megtaláltad a francia zászlót! Menj vissza a franciához.",
      "sourceEnText": "You found the French flag! Go back to the French man.",
      "audioFile": "fr_00_0a9b166.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "shelley",
      "actorId": "NARRATOR",
      "durationMs": 3082,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T01:20:38Z",
      "textHash": "acc89b61df25c96af909dd15ebdfccace96a839df155d51db020c26898c41e86"
    },
    {
      "key": "0a9f34e",
      "nodeTitle": "france_npc",
      "sourceText": "Tudsz nekem segíteni?",
      "sourceEnText": "Can you help us?",
      "audioFile": "fr_00_0a9f34e.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "shelley",
      "actorId": "KID_F",
      "durationMs": 1463,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T01:19:21Z",
      "textHash": "ad2db54deea2a6f2dbece3940f3395996862d446d71970721d453767e3a5bc98"
    },
    {
      "key": "0ab3dd9",
      "nodeTitle": "spawned_france",
      "sourceText": "Franciaország Európa második legnagyobb országa Ukrajna után.",
      "sourceEnText": "France is the second biggest country in the Europe after Ukraine.",
      "audioFile": "fr_00_0ab3dd9.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "shelley",
      "actorId": "KID_M",
      "durationMs": 3918,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T01:20:34Z",
      "textHash": "5259c653bbef117ca316430bc8990adfb096c566c09a0bcfa5fa5155fd4ac6be"
    },
    {
      "key": "0b11066",
      "nodeTitle": "item_flag_belgium",
      "sourceText": "Belgium zászlaja.",
      "sourceEnText": "Flag of Belgium.",
      "audioFile": "fr_00_0b11066.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "shelley",
      "actorId": "NARRATOR",
      "durationMs": 1306,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T01:20:12Z",
      "textHash": "3a1664b14f84ffeb42295a98a8c288c2f55cd25730a1d0e6ce2a6d5fc84d740a"
    },
    {
      "key": "0b18893",
      "nodeTitle": "belgium_npc",
      "sourceText": "Beszélünk franciául is!",
      "sourceEnText": "We also speak French!",
      "audioFile": "fr_00_0b18893.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "shelley",
      "actorId": "SENIOR_F",
      "durationMs": 1463,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T01:20:07Z",
      "textHash": "10a5ff73cc4f05febacfcb231f38977be6a3b7c83af0cfec9b46a42e70cd5730"
    },
    {
      "key": "0b22d58",
      "nodeTitle": "luxembourg_npc",
      "sourceText": "Moien! Luxemburgból származom!",
      "sourceEnText": "Moien! I’m from Luxembourg!",
      "audioFile": "fr_00_0b22d58.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "shelley",
      "actorId": "SENIOR_M",
      "durationMs": 1776,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T01:20:18Z",
      "textHash": "c5b40e0424dfb253ded526c3309e06ba11e597551706965c85f285b901c29eff"
    },
    {
      "key": "0ba3c4c",
      "nodeTitle": "win",
      "sourceText": "Jó munkát! Megcsináltad!",
      "sourceEnText": "Good job! You did it!",
      "audioFile": "fr_00_0ba3c4c.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "shelley",
      "actorId": "KID_F",
      "durationMs": 1646,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T01:18:40Z",
      "textHash": "50a2087a0ac4485049918f7f317a749aa8db5fd3ff96cde34170c6dcf9592f59"
    },
    {
      "key": "0ba8707",
      "nodeTitle": "germany_npc",
      "sourceText": "Danke! Ez az én zászlóm!",
      "sourceEnText": "Danke! That is my flag!",
      "audioFile": "fr_00_0ba8707.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "shelley",
      "actorId": "ADULT_M",
      "durationMs": 1698,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T01:19:26Z",
      "textHash": "f02c8ccfcff75d5c71a081b3aa688cdbbc00bba51c0d586370ec2af70e3bb6f4"
    },
    {
      "key": "0bda0fc",
      "nodeTitle": "italy_npc",
      "sourceText": "Ciao! Olaszországból származom!",
      "sourceEnText": "Ciao! I'm from Italy!",
      "audioFile": "fr_00_0bda0fc.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "shelley",
      "actorId": "KID_M",
      "durationMs": 1776,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T01:19:57Z",
      "textHash": "11037b7283f66857b4ededf19595256bef03e431e1a029740539964b8ee04048"
    },
    {
      "key": "0bf6b0d",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_swiss",
      "sourceText": "Híresek vagyunk a havas hegyekről és a sajtokról.",
      "sourceEnText": "We're famous for snowy mountains and cheese.",
      "audioFile": "fr_00_0bf6b0d.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "shelley",
      "actorId": "ADULT_F",
      "durationMs": 3030,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T01:18:53Z",
      "textHash": "64b7a485cfc62455c58d14991503d0546c1d7c1445aee6e3cea02a90cf2592cf"
    },
    {
      "key": "0c097e4",
      "nodeTitle": "spawned_france",
      "sourceText": "Franciaországban van az Eiffel-torony, egy hatalmas vastorony, amely éjszaka csillog.",
      "sourceEnText": "In France there is the Eiffel Tower, a giant iron tower that sparkles at night.",
      "audioFile": "fr_00_0c097e4.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "shelley",
      "actorId": "KID_M",
      "durationMs": 4807,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T01:20:50Z",
      "textHash": "84a406c20f33d2be24df01b2401c1510c877d07c02174230ba2fd6bb03bb3b12"
    },
    {
      "key": "0c48a14",
      "nodeTitle": "post_quest_activity",
      "sourceText": "Most le tudod rajzolni a zászlót?",
      "sourceEnText": "Can you draw your flag now?",
      "audioFile": "fr_00_0c48a14.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "shelley",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2011,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T01:20:31Z",
      "textHash": "34bde72ee8a36f022a00ec9bb60d9ad4d99d6acfa9727371fc6a4b99dbdd0cd9"
    },
    {
      "key": "0c57e40",
      "nodeTitle": "spain_npc",
      "sourceText": "Ez az én zászlóm!",
      "sourceEnText": "That is my flag!",
      "audioFile": "fr_00_0c57e40.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "shelley",
      "actorId": "NARRATOR",
      "durationMs": 1306,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T01:19:39Z",
      "textHash": "8620fba6e3b8e6512c004c7abaa1cfb5a2cb11a3e655e35178fce590e7f568ec"
    },
    {
      "key": "0ca99a0",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_swiss",
      "sourceText": "Köszönöm, hogy visszahoztad a zászlómat!",
      "sourceEnText": "Thank you for bringing my flag back!",
      "audioFile": "fr_00_0ca99a0.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "shelley",
      "actorId": "ADULT_F",
      "durationMs": 2247,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T01:18:49Z",
      "textHash": "c948698a96a401e7a46aa1a0cf9cf3ecd5d7f292bc7339e1d942a5d1e14b3d07"
    },
    {
      "key": "0caad5a",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_swiss",
      "sourceText": "A zászlónk piros, fehér kereszttel.",
      "sourceEnText": "Our flag is red with a white cross.",
      "audioFile": "fr_00_0caad5a.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "shelley",
      "actorId": "ADULT_F",
      "durationMs": 2299,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T01:18:50Z",
      "textHash": "fc3d37f9065bfad4b2f83634bdbe1f56a3af3511083e59bf99ad3085afb636db"
    },
    {
      "key": "0cd7024",
      "nodeTitle": "germany_npc",
      "sourceText": "A zászlónk fekete, piros és sárga csíkokból áll.",
      "sourceEnText": "Our flag has black, red and yellow stripes.",
      "audioFile": "fr_00_0cd7024.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "shelley",
      "actorId": "ADULT_M",
      "durationMs": 2952,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T01:19:30Z",
      "textHash": "cbb6e3a981737fd6cdda8bb5ed3382765e2b8a4a2319fd80eda1bd857ecd6ce9"
    },
    {
      "key": "0cde44c",
      "nodeTitle": "task_italy",
      "sourceText": "Zöld, fehér és piros, mint egy pizza!",
      "sourceEnText": "It is green, white, and red like a pizza!",
      "audioFile": "fr_00_0cde44c.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "shelley",
      "actorId": "KID_M",
      "durationMs": 2116,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T01:20:00Z",
      "textHash": "77e299dce448b6c9a0b2b27957a8f98370962b25a8cbe0eb6a5f686f920ce320"
    },
    {
      "key": "0d2e2d7",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_swiss",
      "sourceText": "Svájc fővárosa Bern!",
      "sourceEnText": "The capital of Switzerland is Bern!",
      "audioFile": "fr_00_0d2e2d7.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "shelley",
      "actorId": "ADULT_F",
      "durationMs": 1541,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T01:18:47Z",
      "textHash": "061d1f70700b11a0eb10bf9ffe9589e02940c33e32536d8767436be5645f0881"
    },
    {
      "key": "0db05da",
      "nodeTitle": "spain_npc",
      "sourceText": "Nem az enyém! Zászlónk piros és sárga.",
      "sourceEnText": "Our flag is red and yellow.",
      "audioFile": "fr_00_0db05da.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "shelley",
      "actorId": "NARRATOR",
      "durationMs": 2482,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T01:19:42Z",
      "textHash": "025ed42068a2e8896eaf53ddd5ec1867381b4a90c86af7139aa802c759e6677b"
    },
    {
      "key": "0dc2c74",
      "nodeTitle": "item_flag_italy",
      "sourceText": "Megtaláltad az olasz zászlót! Menj vissza Olaszországba!",
      "sourceEnText": "You found the Italian flag! Go back to Italy.",
      "audioFile": "fr_00_0dc2c74.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "shelley",
      "actorId": "NARRATOR",
      "durationMs": 3318,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T01:20:42Z",
      "textHash": "1c6b2b3d713c8c5e5dfc2eaf75fbe9db0c12ba1ed499bf8217477cd985451522"
    },
    {
      "key": "0dc315a",
      "nodeTitle": "monaco",
      "sourceText": "Kis ország vagyunk. Autóversenyek vannak nálunk, és egy tengerparti palotánk is!",
      "sourceEnText": "We are a small country. We have car races and a palace by the sea!",
      "audioFile": "fr_00_0dc315a.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "shelley",
      "actorId": "ADULT_M",
